WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:09.710
Part three: the minor release. Levy requires it for volunteers under eighteen. The student signs first, then a parent or guardian.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:15.531
Step one. While the release is missing, it shows on the student's volunteer page.

00:00:15.731 --> 00:00:18.450
Tap Sign the minor release online.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:24.207
Step two. The student checks their name, signs with a finger, and checks the box.

00:00:24.407 --> 00:00:27.980
Then choose how your parent or guardian will sign.

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:36.105
Step three. If they're with you, pick, They're here with me now. Your parent enters their name, and confirms you're at least sixteen.

00:00:36.305 --> 00:00:39.911
Then your parent signs, and checks the box under their signature.

00:00:40.111 --> 00:00:42.920
Tap Sign and submit, and you're done.

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:50.299
Step four. Not together? Pick, Send it to them, and tap Sign and send. Then text the link to your parent.

00:00:50.499 --> 00:00:59.000
Or copy the link, and send it any way you like. It works for fourteen days, and your release files itself as soon as they sign.

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:03.080
Up next, part four: Creating Legends.
